    <description>REV-57 follow-up (Ken F) + Triage Cockpit Phase B: before-save multi-stamp. (1) On create or person change, stamp Work Areas + Work Jurisdictions from the linked Contact/Lead. (2) B4: stamp Date_Completed__c ONCE when Sales_Stage__c reaches Converted/Disqualified and the field is null — never overwrites (point-in-time first close; replaces the two classic Workflow Rules, deliberately dropping the old un-stamp-on-reopen behaviour). (3) B1: clear Routing_Overdue__c when a User (not queue) owns the record. No DML (before-save).</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>ownerIsUser</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>BEGINS({!$Record.OwnerId}, &quot;005&quot;)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>personStampNeeded</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>AND(
OR(NOT(ISBLANK({!$Record.Contact__c})), NOT(ISBLANK({!$Record.Lead__c}))),
OR(ISNEW(), ISCHANGED({!$Record.Contact__c}), ISCHANGED({!$Record.Lead__c}))
)</expression>
    </formulas>
